<title>FIJI: SOCCER-FIJI BEAT PAPUA NEW GUINEA 3-1.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FIJI BEAT PAPUA NEW GUINEA 3-1.</headline>
<dateline>SUVA, Fiji 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fiji beat Papua New Guinea 3-1 (halftime 2-0) in an Oceania group two World Cup qualifying match at the National Stadium on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Fiji - Simon Peters (20th), Esala Masi (25th), Livai Duguca (88th)</p>
<p>Papua New Guinea - Wesley Waiwai (69th)</p>
